<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>The speaking members manifest the Spirit;</l><l>Thus, their gifts are exercised.</l><l>These gifts, however, are not for themselves,</l><l>But for the Body of Christ.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Let us forget our spirituality</l><l>And only for the Body care.</l><l>’Tis then the Lord will multiply our gifts</l><l>And through us gain His heart’s desire.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
